---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - IPPriv | Usage Terms and Conditions"
  description="Terms for using the IPPriv website, IP lookup tool and free API: acceptable use, rate limits, data accuracy and liability."
  keywords="terms of service, IPPriv terms, API terms, acceptable use"
  type="article"
>
  <LegalPage title="Terms of Service" updated="October 6, 2026" toc={[
    { id: 'agreement', label: '1. Agreement' },
    { id: 'the-service', label: '2. The service' },
    { id: 'api-use', label: '3. API use' },
    { id: 'accuracy-of-results', label: '4. Accuracy of results' },
    { id: 'intellectual-property', label: '5. Intellectual property' },
    { id: 'warranty-and-liability', label: '6. Warranty and liability' },
    { id: 'changes-and-applicable-law', label: '7. Changes and applicable law' },
    { id: 'contact', label: '8. Contact' },
  ]}>
    <section id="agreement">
      <h2>1. Agreement</h2>
      <p>
        These terms govern your use of www.ippriv.com and api.ippriv.com, operated by LMF Solutions (see the
        <a href="/legal">Legal Notice</a>). By using the site, the IP lookup tool or the API, you accept them.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="the-service">
      <h2>2. The service</h2>
      <p>
        IPPriv provides free IP lookup, geolocation, reverse DNS and VPN, proxy and Tor detection, through the
        website and a public API. No account is needed. We may change, suspend or stop any part of the service at
        any time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="api-use">
      <h2>3. API use</h2>
      <h3>3.1 Rate limit</h3>
      <p>
        The free API allows 100 requests per hour per IP address. Requests above the limit receive an HTTP 429
        response. Repeated abuse can lead to a block.
      </p>
      <h3>3.2 Prohibited uses</h3>
      <p>You may not use the site or the API to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>break the law or help others do so;</li>
        <li>harass, stalk or track individuals;</li>
        <li>send spam or distribute malware;</li>
        <li>attack, overload or bypass the security of the service;</li>
        <li>resell the service or its data without written permission.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="accuracy-of-results">
      <h2>4. Accuracy of results</h2>
      <p>
        IP data comes from third-party sources and is an estimate. Location is often accurate at country level and
        much less precise at city level, and VPN or proxy detection can produce false positives or negatives. Do not
        rely on results alone for decisions that affect people's rights.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="intellectual-property">
      <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The site's content, design and code belong to LMF Solutions or its licensors. API responses may be used in
        your own projects in line with these terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="warranty-and-liability">
      <h2>6. Warranty and liability</h2>
      <p>
        The service is provided "as is", without warranty of availability, accuracy or fitness for a particular
        purpose. To the extent allowed by law, LMF Solutions is not liable for indirect damages arising from the
        use of, or inability to use, the service.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="changes-and-applicable-law">
      <h2>7. Changes and applicable law</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms; the date at the top shows the latest version. These terms are governed by French
        law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </LegalPage>
</Layout>
